  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/1"/>Under Your shield have come the children
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/2"/>who were exiled;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/3"/>Your children have gathered in Your house,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/4"/>awed and upset.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/5"/>Recall the kindliness of their forefathers
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/6"/>when they come to be judged;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/7"/>in truth and peace they meet,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/8"/>that one facing this one.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_7/9"/>This sign will take place tomorrow.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
